databases.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:32.590
One of our two speakers, Ananth Grama, is
the Samuel Conte Professor of Computer Science

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.370
at Purdue
University, where he has areas of research

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:40.960
